Rem The Devices panel (F12) and the hint for a disk AMOS asks for, driven by panel.input (host only)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0 : Ink 3 : Text 20,30,"AMOS behind the panel"
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/ready" : Close 9
Wait 600
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/asking" : Close 9
Open In 2,"Disk2:b.txt" : Line Input #2,B$ : Close 2
Ink 5 : Text 20,60,B$
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/done" : Close 9
Wait 700
Print #1,B$
